/**
\fn pdg::Sprite::seekAnimation(string clip, number timeSeconds)
\brief Select a clip and time immediately.

Cancels an active pose transition and legacy blend, while preserving the playback pause state. Validates the requested sample before changing the current selection.

\param clip Name of a compatible clip in the current Spriter entity.
\param timeSeconds Finite sample time in seconds. Looping clips wrap, including negative times; nonlooping clips clamp to their endpoints.

\return No value.

\note Call enableAnimationPose() successfully before using this method. Call outside animation callbacks.

\par Example
\code{.js}
sprite.seekAnimation('reference', 0.25);
\endcode

\see sampleAnimationPose(), transitionToAnimation()
*/
